{"r":"jsm","lane":{"p":424,"e":[{"h":"جَسُمَ","t":["(S, Msb, K, &c.,) aor. , (K,) inf. n. ",[2,"جَسَامَةٌ"],", (Msb, TA,) ",[1,"He,"]," or ",[1,"it,"]," (a thing, S,) ",[1,"was,"]," or ",[1,"became, great,"]," or ",[1,"large:"]," (S, K:) or so ",[2,"جَسِمَ"],", aor. , inf. n. ",[2,"جَسَمٌ"],": and the former, ",[1,"it"]," (a thing) ",[1,"was,"]," or ",[1,"it, was,"]," or ",[1,"became, great, big,"]," or ",[1,"bulky:"]," (Msb:) or ",[1,"he,"]," or ",[1,"it, was,"]," or ",[1,"became, great,"]," or ",[1,"large, in body:"]," (KL:) or ",[1,"he,"]," or ",[1,"it, was,"]," or ",[1,"became, corpulent;"]," or ",[1,"corporeal,"]," or ",[1,"bodied;"]," as also ↓ ",[2,"تجسّم"],". (MA, PS.)"],"f":"1"},{"h":"جسّم","t":["inf. n. ",[2,"تَجْسِيمٌ"],", ",[1,"He,"]," or ",[1,"it, made,"]," or ",[1,"rendered, corporeal;"]," or ",[1,"great, large, big,"]," or ",[1,"bulky."]," (KL.) ― -b2- [",[1,"He made to be solid,"]," or ",[1,"to have length and breadth and thickness."],"]"],"f":"2"},{"h":"تَجَسَّمَ","t":["see 1. ― -b2- [Hence,] ",[2,"تجسّم فِى عَيْنِى كَذَا"]," (tropical:) ",[1,"Such a thing assumed a form,"]," or ",[1,"shape,"]," [or ",[1,"an embodiment,"],"] ",[1,"in my eye."]," (TA.) And ",[2,"تجسّم"],[2,"فُلَانٌ مِنَ الكَرَمِ"]," (tropical:) [app. ",[1,"Such a one was,"]," or ",[1,"became, an embodiment of generosity"],"]. (TA.) And ",[2,"كَأَنَّهُ"],[2,"كَرَمٌ قَدْ تَجَسَّمَ"]," (tropical:) [app. ",[1,"As though he were generosity embodied"],"]. (TA.) -A2- ",[2,"تجسّم فُلَانًا"]," (tropical:) ",[1,"He chose such a one"]," (S, K, TA) ",[2,"مِنْ بَيْنِ القَوْمِ"]," [",[1,"from among the people,"]," or ",[1,"party"],"], (S,) or ",[2,"مِنَ العَشِيرَةِ"],[2,"فَأَرْسَلَهُ"]," [",[1,"from the kinsfolk,"]," or ",[1,"tribe,"]," &c., ",[1,"and sent him"],"]: (TA:) as though he directed his course, or aim, to, or towards, his ",[2,"جِسْم"]," [or body]; like as you say, ",[2,"تَأَيَّيْتُهُ"],", meaning “ I directed my course, or aim, to, or towards, his ",[2,"آيَة"],", and his ",[2,"شَخْص"],". ” (S.) [See also 5 in art. ",[2,"جشم"],".] One says also, ",[2,"تَجَسَّمْهَا نَاقَةً مِنَ الإِبِلِ قَٱنْحَرْهَا"]," [",[1,"Choose thou her, a she-camel from among the camels, and stick her"],"]. (TA.) ― -b2- ",[2,"تجسّم الأَرْضَ"]," (assumed tropical:) ",[1,"He betook himself towards the land,"]," or ",[1,"country,"]," (S, K,) ",[1,"desiring"],[1,"to go thither."]," (S.) ― -b3- ",[2,"تجسّم الرَّمْلَ"],", (S, K,) and ",[2,"الجَبَلَ"],", (S,) (assumed tropical:) ",[1,"He mounted,"]," or ",[1,"ascended, the greater part of the sand,"]," (S, K,) and ",[1,"of the mountain."]," (S.) [See also 5 in art. ",[2,"جشم"],".] ― -b4- ",[2,"تجسّم"],[2,"الأَمْرَ"]," (tropical:) ",[1,"i. q."],[2,"رَكِبَ مُعْظَمَهُ"],"; (S, K, TA;) i. e., ",[1,"He ventured upon, embarked in,"]," or ",[1,"undertook, the main part,"]," or ",[1,"bulk, of the affair:"]," (TK:) or ",[1,"he constrained himself to do it,"]," or ",[1,"perform it;"]," as also ",[2,"تجشّمهُ"],": (Aboo-Mihjen, Aboo-Turáb, TA:) or both these verbs signify ",[1,"he took it,"]," or ",[1,"imposed it, upon himself,"]," or ",[1,"he undertook it, in spite of difficulty"]," or ",[1,"trouble"]," or ",[1,"inconvenience."]," (Aboo-Turáb, TA in art. ",[2,"جشم"],".) You say also, ",[2,"فُلَانٌ"]," ↓ ",[2,"يَتَجَسَّمَ المَجَاسِمَ"]," and ",[2,"يَتَجَشَّمُ المَجَاشِمَ"]," (tropical:) [app. meaning ",[1,"Such a one undertakes, in spite of difficulty"]," or ",[1,"trouble"]," or ",[1,"inconvenience, those things,"]," or ",[1,"affairs, that are causes of difficulty"]," or ",[1,"trouble"]," or ",[1,"inconvenience;"]," i. e., ",[1,"difficult,"]," or ",[1,"troublesome,"]," or ",[1,"inconvenient things"]," or ",[1,"affairs:"]," supposing the two nouns to be pls. of which the sings. are ",[2,"مَجْسَمَةٌ"]," and ",[2,"مَجْشَمَةٌ"],", of the measure ",[2,"مَفْعَلَةٌ"],", like ",[2,"مَبْخَلَةٌ"]," and ",[2,"مَجْبَنَةٌ"]," and ",[2,"مَشَّقَةٌ"]," (originally ",[2,"مَشْقَقَةٌ"],") &c.]. (TA.)"],"f":"5"},{"h":"جِسْمٌ","t":["The ",[1,"body, with the limbs"]," or ",[1,"members;"]," syn. ",[2,"جَسَدٌ"],"; (AZ, S, Msb;) as also ↓ ",[2,"جُسْمَانٌ"]," and ",[2,"جُثْمَانٌ"],": (AZ, S, Msb: *) or ",[2,"جِسْمٌ"]," and ↓ ",[2,"جُسْمَانٌ"]," are syn. with ",[2,"جَسَدٌ"],"; (As, S;) or signify the ",[1,"whole body and limbs"]," or ",[1,"members"]," of a man, (K, and T and Msb in explanation of ",[2,"جسم"],",) and of a beast, a camel, and the like, (T, Msb,) and of any other species, (K,) of large make; (T, Msb, K;) and ",[2,"جُثْمَانٌ"]," is syn. with ",[2,"شَخْصٌ"]," [app. as meaning “ a person ”]; and ↓ ",[2,"جُسْمَانٌ"]," signifies the ",[1,"whole"],[2,"جِسْم"]," of a man: (As, S:) or ",[2,"جِسْمٌ"]," signifies [",[1,"a body,"]," or ",[1,"material substance; a solid;"],"] ",[1,"a thing having length and breadth and thickness;"]," so that, when it is cut and divided, no portion thereof ceases to be a ",[2,"جِسْم"],"; whereas a ",[2,"شَخْص"]," [meaning “ a person ”] ceases to be a ",[2,"شَخْص"]," by its being divided: (Er-Rághib, TA:) ",[1,"a thing that is capable of being divided in length and breadth and thickness"]," is called ",[2,"جِسْمٌ طَبِيعِىٌّ"],", and also, because it is a subject of investigation, or inquiry, in instruction in the mathematical studies, ",[2,"جِسْمٌ"],[2,"تَعْلِيمِىٌّ"],": (KT:) pl. [of pauc.] ",[2,"أَجْسَامٌ"]," and [of mult] ",[2,"جُسُومٌ"],". (K.) You say, ",[2,"ثَابَ جِسْمُهُ"],", (M, A, K, in art. ",[2,"ثوب"],",) and ",[2,"أَثَابَ جِسْمُهُ"],", (IKt, M, ib.,) and ",[2,"ثَابَ إِلَيْهِ جِسْمُهُ"],", (T, M, A, ib.,) (tropical:) ",[1,"He became fat, after leanness;"]," (A;) ",[1,"his good state of body returned to him;"]," (M, K; *) ",[1,"his condition of body became good, after extenuation; and health,"]," or ",[1,"soundness, thereof returned to him."]," (T.) And ↓ ",[2,"إِنَّهُ لَحَنِيفُ الجُسْمَانِ"]," [",[1,"Verily he is slender, spare,"]," or ",[1,"lean, of body"],"]. (TA.) ― -b2- ",[2,"الأَجْسَامُ المُخْتَلِفَةُ الطَّبَائِعِ"]," [",[1,"The material substances of different natures;"]," also called ",[2,"الأَجْسَامُ"],[2,"السَّبْعَةُ"],[1,"the seven material substances,"]," and ",[2,"الفِلِذَاتُ"],"; namely,] ",[1,"the"],[2,"عَنَاصِر"]," [which are the ",[1,"four elements, fire, air, earth, and water,"],"] ",[1,"and the three products composed of these,"]," (KT,) which are ",[1,"minerals, vegetables, and animals."]," (Note in a copy of the KT.) ",[2,"الأَجْسَامُ الطَّبِيعِيَّهُ"],", as used by those who study to discover occult things, signifies ",[1,"The"],[2,"عَرْش"],[1,"and the"],[2,"كُرْسِىّ"],": and ",[2,"الأَجْسَامُ العُنْصُرِيَّةُ"],", ",[1,"everything beside these two, of the heavens and the"]," [",[1,"elements termed"],"] ",[2,"أُسْطُقُسَات"],[1,"therein."]," (KT.)"]},{"h":"جِسْمِىٌّ","t":["[ ",[1,"Bodily,"]," or ",[1,"corporeal."],"]"]},{"h":"جِسْمِيَّةٌ","t":["[ ",[1,"Bodiliness,"]," or ",[1,"corporeity."],"]"]},{"h":"جُسْمَانٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"جِسْمٌ"],", in four places."]},{"h":"جُسْمَانِىٌّ","t":[": see ",[2,"جَسِيمٌ"],"."]},{"h":"جُسَامٌ","t":[": see what next follows"]},{"h":"جَسِيمٌ","t":[[1,"Great; large;"]," (S, Msb, K;) as also ↓ ",[2,"جُسَامٌ"],": (S, K:) ",[1,"big; bulky:"]," (Msb:) fem. with ",[2,"ة"],": (K:) pl. ",[2,"جِسَامٌ"]," (S, Msb) [and ",[2,"جُسُمٌ"]," also, like as ",[2,"جُدُدٌ"]," is pl. of ",[2,"جَدِيدٌ"],"]: and ",[1,"corpulent, large in body,"]," or ",[1,"big-bodied;"]," (K, * TA;) as also ↓ ",[2,"جُسْمَانِىٌّ"],", applied to a man. (TA.) You say, ",[2,"هُوَ مِنْ جِسَامِ الأُمُورِ"]," [",[1,"It is one of great affairs"]," or ",[1,"events"],"]: and ",[2,"مِنْ"],[2,"جَسِيمَاتِ الخُطُوبِ"]," [",[1,"meaning the same,"]," or ",[1,"of great afflictions"]," or ",[1,"calamities"],"]. (TA.) And ",[2,"جُسُمٌ"]," [likewise, or ",[2,"أُمُورٌ جُسُمٌ"],",] signifies ",[1,"Great affairs"]," or ",[1,"events."]," (TA.) ",[2,"جَسِيمُ الأَمْرِ"]," signifies [also] The ",[1,"bulk,"]," or the ",[1,"greater, main, principal,"]," or ",[1,"chief, part, of the affair;"]," and so ",[2,"الأَمْرِ"]," ↓ ",[2,"أَجْسَمُ"],". (S.) ― -b2- [The pl.] ",[2,"جُسُمٌ"]," also signifies (assumed tropical:) ",[1,"Intelligent men."]," (TA.) ― -b3- ",[2,"جَسِيمُ الأَرْضِ"],[1,"Elevated land over which water has risen:"]," (K, * TA:) pl. ",[2,"جِسَامٌ"],". (K.)"]},{"h":"أَجْسَمُ","t":[[1,"Greater, larger, bigger,"]," or ",[1,"bulkier;"]," or ",[1,"greatest, largest, biggest,"]," or ",[1,"bulkiest."]," (S, K.) See also ",[2,"جَسِيمٌ"],"."]},{"h":"مَجَاسِمُ","t":[": see 5, last sentence."]},{"h":"جسو","t":[": omitted in some copies of the S."]},{"h":"جَسَا","t":["(S, M, Msb, K,) aor. , (M, Msb, K,) inf. n. ",[2,"جَسْوٌ"]," (M, K) and ",[2,"جُسُوٌّ"],", (M, TA,) ",[1,"He,"]," or ",[1,"it,"]," (a man, M, TA, or a thing, Msb,) ",[1,"was,"]," or ",[1,"became, hard, tough, rigid,"]," or ",[1,"stiff:"]," (M, Msb, K:) [see also ",[2,"جَسَأَ"],": or, said of a man,] ",[1,"he was,"]," or ",[1,"became, hard, rough, harsh,"]," or ",[1,"ungentle; contr. of"],[2,"لَطُفَ"],". (S.) And ",[2,"جَسَتِ اليَدُ"],", inf. n. ",[2,"جُسُوٌّ"]," and ",[2,"جَسًا"],", ",[1,"The hand,"]," or ",[1,"arm, was,"]," or ",[1,"became, dry,"]," or ",[1,"tough,"]," or ",[1,"hard,"]," (S, TA,) ",[1,"in the bones, with little flesh;"]," (TA;) and in the same sense the verb is said of other things. (S.) ― -b2- ",[1,"It"]," (water) ",[1,"congealed,"]," or ",[1,"froze."]," (S, TA.) ― -b3- Also, inf. n. ",[2,"جُسُوٌّ"],", ",[1,"He"]," (an old man) ",[1,"attained the utmost age"]," [",[1,"so that his limbs became rigid"],"]. (S, TA.)"],"f":"1"},{"h":"جاساهُ","t":["(K,) inf. n. ",[2,"مُجَاسَاةٌ"],", (TA.) ",[1,"He treated him,"]," or ",[1,"regarded him, with enmity,"]," or ",[1,"hostility."]," (K, TA.)"],"f":"3"},{"h":"يَدٌ جَاسِيَةٌ","t":[[1,"A hand,"]," or ",[1,"an arm, dry,"]," or ",[1,"tough,"]," or ",[1,"hard, in the bones, with little flesh."]," (TA.) And ",[2,"دَابَّةٌ جَاسِيَةٌ القَوَائِمِ"],[1,"A beast having tough,"]," or ",[1,"hard, legs."]," (TA.) And ",[2,"رِمَاحٌ جَاسِيَةٌ"],[1,"Stiff, rigid,"]," or ",[1,"tough, and hard, spears."]," (TA.) [See also ",[2,"جَاسِئٌ"],", in art. ",[2,"جسأ"],".]"]}]},"maqayis":["الجيم والسين والميم يدل على تجمع الشيء. فالجسم كل شخص مدرك. كذا قال ابن دريد. والجسيم: العظيم الجسم، وكذلك الجسام. والجسمان: الشخص."],"mufradat":["الجسم: ما له طول وعرض وعمق، ولا تخرج أجزاء الجسم عن كونها أجساما وإن قطع ما قطع، وجزئ ما قد جزئ. قال الله تعالى: وزاده بسطة في العلم والجسم [البقرة/ 247] ، وإذا رأيتهم تعجبك أجسامهم [المنافقون/ 4] ، تنبيها أن لا وراء الأشباح معنى معتد به، والجسمان قيل: هو الشخص، والشخص قد يخرج من كونه شخصا بتقطيعه وتجزئته بخلاف الجسم."]}